{"k":"3d","t":"Three-Dimensional Geometry","cls":"12","u":"Vectors & 3D","s":[["Points and direction ratios",[{"q":"Distance and section formula in 3D","f":"d=\\sqrt{(x_2-x_1)^2+(y_2-y_1)^2+(z_2-z_1)^2};\\qquad\\left(\\frac{mx_2+nx_1}{m+n},\\dots\\right)"},{"q":"Direction ratios of the line through two points","f":"(x_2-x_1,\\ y_2-y_1,\\ z_2-z_1)","n":"Direction cosines $=\\frac{\\text{d.r.}}{\\sqrt{a^2+b^2+c^2}}$."},{"q":"Angle between two lines","f":"\\cos\\theta=\\frac{a_1a_2+b_1b_2+c_1c_2}{\\sqrt{a_1^2+b_1^2+c_1^2}\\sqrt{a_2^2+b_2^2+c_2^2}}","n":"Perpendicular: $a_1a_2+b_1b_2+c_1c_2=0$; parallel: $\\frac{a_1}{a_2}=\\frac{b_1}{b_2}=\\frac{c_1}{c_2}$."},{"q":"Projection of a segment on a line","f":"(x_2-x_1)l+(y_2-y_1)m+(z_2-z_1)n"}]],["Lines",[{"q":"Equation of a line","f":"\\vec r=\\vec a+\\lambda\\vec b;\\qquad\\frac{x-x_1}{a}=\\frac{y-y_1}{b}=\\frac{z-z_1}{c}","n":"Two-point form: $\\frac{x-x_1}{x_2-x_1}=\\frac{y-y_1}{y_2-y_1}=\\frac{z-z_1}{z_2-z_1}$."},{"q":"Shortest distance between skew lines","f":"d=\\frac{|(\\vec a_2-\\vec a_1)\\cdot(\\vec b_1\\times\\vec b_2)|}{|\\vec b_1\\times\\vec b_2|}","n":"Lines intersect iff $(\\vec a_2-\\vec a_1)\\cdot(\\vec b_1\\times\\vec b_2)=0$ (and not parallel)."},{"q":"Distance between parallel lines","f":"d=\\frac{|(\\vec a_2-\\vec a_1)\\times\\vec b|}{|\\vec b|}"},{"q":"Perpendicular distance of a point from a line","f":"d=\\frac{|(\\vec p-\\vec a)\\times\\vec b|}{|\\vec b|}","n":"Foot: take a general point $\\vec a+\\lambda\\vec b$ and use $(\\text{foot}-\\vec p)\\cdot\\vec b=0$."},{"q":"Coplanarity of two lines","f":"\\begin{vmatrix}x_2-x_1&y_2-y_1&z_2-z_1\\\\a_1&b_1&c_1\\\\a_2&b_2&c_2\\end{vmatrix}=0"}]],["Planes",[{"q":"Equation of a plane","f":"\\vec r\\cdot\\hat n=d;\\qquad ax+by+cz+d=0;\\qquad\\frac xa+\\frac yb+\\frac zc=1","n":"$(a,b,c)$ is normal to $ax+by+cz+d=0$. Normal form: $lx+my+nz=p$."},{"q":"Plane through a point with a given normal","f":"a(x-x_1)+b(y-y_1)+c(z-z_1)=0"},{"q":"Plane through three points","f":"\\begin{vmatrix}x-x_1&y-y_1&z-z_1\\\\x_2-x_1&y_2-y_1&z_2-z_1\\\\x_3-x_1&y_3-y_1&z_3-z_1\\end{vmatrix}=0"},{"q":"Distance of a point from a plane","f":"d=\\frac{|ax_1+by_1+cz_1+d|}{\\sqrt{a^2+b^2+c^2}}"},{"q":"Distance between parallel planes","f":"d=\\frac{|d_1-d_2|}{\\sqrt{a^2+b^2+c^2}}"},{"q":"Angle between two planes","f":"\\cos\\theta=\\frac{|a_1a_2+b_1b_2+c_1c_2|}{\\sqrt{\\sum a_1^2}\\sqrt{\\sum a_2^2}}"},{"q":"Angle between a line and a plane","f":"\\sin\\phi=\\frac{|al+bm+cn|}{\\sqrt{a^2+b^2+c^2}\\sqrt{l^2+m^2+n^2}}","n":"Line $\\parallel$ plane iff $al+bm+cn=0$; line $\\perp$ plane iff $\\frac la=\\frac mb=\\frac nc$."},{"q":"Family of planes through a line of intersection","f":"P_1+\\lambda P_2=0"},{"q":"Foot of perpendicular and image in a plane","f":"\\frac{x-x_1}a=\\frac{y-y_1}b=\\frac{z-z_1}c=-\\frac{ax_1+by_1+cz_1+d}{a^2+b^2+c^2}\\ (\\text{foot});\\ \\ \\times2\\ \\text{for image}"},{"q":"Bisector planes","f":"\\frac{a_1x+b_1y+c_1z+d_1}{\\sqrt{a_1^2+b_1^2+c_1^2}}=\\pm\\frac{a_2x+b_2y+c_2z+d_2}{\\sqrt{a_2^2+b_2^2+c_2^2}}"},{"q":"Plane containing a line and a point / two lines","f":"\\text{normal}=\\vec b_1\\times\\vec b_2\\ \\text{or}\\ \\vec b\\times(\\vec p-\\vec a)"},{"q":"Line of intersection of two planes","f":"\\text{direction}=\\vec n_1\\times\\vec n_2;\\ \\text{point: put } z=0\\ \\text{and solve}"}]],["Common results",[{"q":"Volume of a tetrahedron","f":"V=\\frac16\\left|\\begin{vmatrix}x_2-x_1&y_2-y_1&z_2-z_1\\\\x_3-x_1&y_3-y_1&z_3-z_1\\\\x_4-x_1&y_4-y_1&z_4-z_1\\end{vmatrix}\\right|"},{"q":"Area of the triangle cut by a plane from the axes","f":"\\frac xa+\\frac yb+\\frac zc=1:\\ \\ \\Delta=\\tfrac12\\sqrt{a^2b^2+b^2c^2+c^2a^2}","n":"Volume of the tetrahedron with the origin $=\\frac{|abc|}6$."},{"q":"Projections of an area","f":"A^2=A_{xy}^2+A_{yz}^2+A_{zx}^2"},{"q":"Sphere (for reference)","f":"|\\vec r-\\vec c|=R;\\qquad x^2+y^2+z^2+2ux+2vy+2wz+d=0,\\ R=\\sqrt{u^2+v^2+w^2-d}"},{"q":"Angle between a diagonal of a cube and an edge / face diagonal","f":"\\cos^{-1}\\tfrac1{\\sqrt3}\\ (\\text{with edge}),\\qquad\\cos^{-1}\\sqrt{\\tfrac23}\\ (\\text{with face diagonal})","n":"Angle between two body diagonals $=\\cos^{-1}\\frac13$."}]]]}